{"id":"6a15697ec1bc8115","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-regular-fibration.md","title":"正则纤维化","display":"df-regular-fibration — 正则纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-regular-fibration","aliases":["16-df-regular-fibration","Regular fibration"],"display":"df-regular-fibration — 正则纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","[[16-df-frobenius]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-regular-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-regular-fibration</span><span>Regular fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-fibration — 正则纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ac2effb31369eeeb\" href=\"?note=ac2effb31369eeeb\" title=\"16-df-frobenius\">16-df-frobenius</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ac2effb31369eeeb\" href=\"?note=ac2effb31369eeeb\" title=\"16-df-frobenius\">16-df-frobenius</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegFib}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ac2effb31369eeeb\" href=\"?note=ac2effb31369eeeb\" title=\"16-df-frobenius\">16-df-frobenius</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原始定义只要求沿积投影的存在量词及其 BC/Frobenius；沿一般基态射的伴随可以在适当条件下推导。</li>\n<li>此处不把任意拉回 BC 或右量词额外塞入正则逻辑的定义。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.2.1(i), p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-frobenius","status":"resolved","id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-frobenius]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-frobenius","status":"resolved","id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；等式、简单余积和 Frobenius 分别见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{EqFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-simple-quantification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-frobenius","status":"resolved","id":"ac2effb31369eeeb","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-frobenius]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{RegFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{EqFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleCoprod}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleFrob}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":1499,"backlinks":[{"id":"e8285984e352a6ff","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；正则性和纤维有限余积见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]。"},{"id":"89d77894202de031","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p$ 为纤维化，$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 见 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{RegFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。"},{"id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegFib}(p)$，$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$，采用 [[16-df-regular-fibration]]。固定 cleavage、基底有限积、纤维终对象 $\\top_L$ 与二元积 $\\wedge_L$；$u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]，$\\Sigma_{A,B}\\dashv\\pi_{A,B}^*$ 采用 [[16-df-simple-quantification]] 的同一伴随族。所有范畴和构造在足够大的宇宙中编码。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-regular-fibration|df-regular-fibration — 正则纤维化]]"},{"id":"5a9f42708ce20d55","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegCat}$、$\\mathrm{RegFib}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-regular-fibration]]。"}],"outgoing":["478c99d853e13c93","e39d17458a2b0aa4","ac2effb31369eeeb"]}